Hi Alice,

Please find attached the latest building plans for the new
office space. Here's a summary of the key changes:

FLOOR PLAN CHANGES:

  * The main entrance has been moved to the south side
    to align with the street access.

  * The open-plan work area has been expanded by 20%.
    We can now accommodate up to 60 people in the main
    workspace.

  * Two new conference rooms have been added on the
    second floor (B2-01 and B2-02), each seating 12.

  * The kitchen area has been redesigned with a double
    island layout and additional storage.

  * A bike storage room has been added to the basement
    level, accessible from the rear alley.

ELECTRICAL:

  * All workstations will have USB-C power delivery
    built into the desks (15W per port, 4 ports per desk).

  * The server room has been upgraded to support 40kW
    of cooling capacity.

  * Emergency lighting has been updated to meet the
    latest fire safety codes.

SCHEDULE:

  * Construction begins: July 1st
  * Expected completion: September 15th
  * Move-in date: October 1st

Please review and let me know if you have any questions
or requested changes. I need your sign-off by Friday so
we can submit the permit application on Monday.

Thanks,
Bob

